---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import DesignMedia from '../components/DesignMedia.astro';
---
<Layout title="Hobbies" page="Hobbies">
  <PageHeading title="Hobbies" subtitle="A behind-the-scenes look into how I spend my time outside of my career." />
  <div class="hobbies-feed">
    <article class="text-post"><h2>A thought worth sharing</h2><div class="post-copy"><p>This is a space for thoughts, stories, and the interests that keep me curious. A text post flows across the page, with room for a quick update or a longer reflection.</p><p>Add another paragraph whenever there’s more to say. The layout grows with the story.</p></div></article>
    <hr />
    <article class="media-row image-left"><div class="row-copy"><h2>A moment in pictures</h2><p>A photo and a few words about the story behind it. Share an interest, a place, or something that caught my eye.</p></div><DesignMedia desktop="20-132" mobile="23-327" alt="Post image placeholder" /></article>
    <hr />
    <article class="media-row"><div class="row-copy"><h2>Something to watch</h2><p>A clip, a performance, or a small story in motion, with a little context alongside it.</p></div><DesignMedia desktop="20-148" mobile="23-337" alt="Video preview placeholder; no video supplied yet" /></article>
  </div>
</Layout>
